Package: lhCore
Title: Resources and Functions to Build a lhCore Course
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("O'Hara", "Casey", , "ohara@nceas.ucsb.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2968-7005"))
Description: 
    This package contains functions to organize course content from a lessons
    package (e.g., lhLessons) into a functional Quarto website.  Helper 
    functions will assist the user to set up a new course repository with 
    selected content arranged in an appropriate structure, and set up Github 
    actions on the course repo to facilitate publishing.  Additional functionality
    will allow the user to compare course lessons back to the lessons repository
    and check in lesson updates and new lessons.
